{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Abraham shall surely become</b> etc. For I know him — a term of endearment, like מודע לאישה (kinsman to a woman); that is to say, he shall become a great nation. Because he is beloved in My eyes and destined to establish many families. And therefore it is fitting to inform him of the judgment I am executing upon Sodom."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:42.734285101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}